WEBVTT

00:08:57.561 --> 00:09:00.611
Cheese, Light,

00:09:00.635 --> 00:09:03.737
Robusto, Rich &amp; Hearty,

00:09:03.761 --> 00:09:05.071
Old World Traditional --

00:09:07.483 --> 00:09:09.200
Extra-Chunky Garden.

00:09:09.224 --> 00:09:10.976
(Laughter)

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.744
That's Howard's doing.

00:09:12.768 --> 00:09:14.976
That is Howard's gift
to the American people.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.681
Now why is that important?

00:09:16.705 --> 00:09:18.976
(Laughter)

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:21.081
It is, in fact, enormously important.

00:09:21.105 --> 00:09:22.475
I'll explain to you why.

00:09:22.499 --> 00:09:26.620
What Howard did is he fundamentally
changed the way the food industry thinks

00:09:26.644 --> 00:09:28.065
about making you happy.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.976
Assumption number one
in the food industry used to be